es to create and customize your own Title Plate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・View global leaderboards updated every month in Latest Rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Complete a variety of different missions to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Some minigame stages from THOSE GAMES and THOSE GAMES 2 also appear in this game as tutorial stages.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New players can use these stages to get used to the mechanics before things get too crazy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or, if you're a THOSE GAMES veteran, skip the tutorial and get right into the extreme action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Either way, the tutorials will always be there for you, so you can play with confidence!</strong></p>", "short_description": "THOSE GAMES are back, and harder than ever! Play upgraded, more difficult versions of familiar minigames to your heart's content! Are you up to the challenge? Are you ready...for THOSE GAMES EXTREME?!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246190/header.jpg?t=1782892502", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246190/75fadb2219d83fb1fbd8ea9d0661f61c8d96fd9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782892502", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246190/75fadb2219d83fb1fbd8ea9d0661f61c8d96fd9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782892502", "website": "https://www.d3p.co.jp/anoge_geki", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 ｜ AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><